ge/Wounding\" title=\"Wounding\">Wounding 2</a>:</b> This weapon saps the health from your enemies, dealing 2 Constitution damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic 4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic 4</a>:</b> On Hit: 4 to 16 Chaos damage. Chaos-aligned creatures are immune to this effect.<br />Penalty: If equipped by a Lawful user, they receive 1 Negative Level for as long as this item is equipped.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Slay_Living_(enchantment)\" title=\"Slay Living (enchantment)\">Slay Living</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Slay_Living_(enchantment)\" title=\"Slay Living (enchantment)\">Slay Living</a>:</b> This weapon stores a dark and sinister power deep within. When the weapon is used, this power occasionally comes to the surface, attempting to instantly snuff out the life force of the enemy.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a